            "typeName": "dataCollectionSituation",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "This is a data donation study.\n\nThe procedure in this data donation study is as follows:\n1) Participants are asked whether they are willing to participate\n2) Participants who are not Instagram users are not eligible to participant \n3) Participants fill in a questionnaire\n4) Participants are directed  to the Port software\n5) Participants get instructions on how to request their Instagram data\n6) Participants request their Instagram data\n7) Participants get instructions on how to download their Instagram data\n8) Participants download their Instagram data\n9) Participants donate parts of their Instagram data through the Port software (see https://datadonation.eu)"
          },
